<title>FINLAND: UPM-KYMMENE 8-MTH PROFIT DOWN 41 PCT.</title>
<headline>UPM-KYMMENE 8-MTH PROFIT DOWN 41 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to end-August, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items   2,672 vs 4,537</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	    8.02 vs 14.51</p>
<p> Net sales				  33,822 vs 35,616</p>
<p> Operating profit			  4,042 vs 5,922</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of analysts forecasts was for a 2,475</p>
<p>million markka profit after financial items. The average was</p>
<p>2,473 million and the range was 2,198 million to 2,835 million.</p>
<p> Depreciation			     2,082 vs 2,040</p>
<p>Share of results</p>
<p> of associated companies	 charge 123 vs 16 charge</p>
<p> Net financial charges		  1,160 vs 1,435</p>
<p> Exchange rate differences	charge 87 vs 66 gain</p>
<p> Extraordinary income			44 vs 412</p>
<p> Extraordinary charges		    140 vs 384</p>
<p> Minorities			   charge 85 vs 67 charge</p>
<p>Profit before appropriations, tax  2,576 vs 4,565</p>
<p> Taxes					  443 vs 625</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations	  2,048 vs 3,873</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	40.9 vs 38.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish forest industry group is</p>
<p>UPM-Kymmene Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
